  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-learns-to-swim-v5-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "dbbf7348468f3a63149833c33985e24ece816906165c14c4c4eceea7ac388334",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7a6754a4f820d76d1262166c0aa9a40d46c2c5ef4da171932075fa13b41a90f4",
      "text": "悟空的\n游泳课",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c2a9f23d653b04cc8bdd7082a5c45c84f8890608590d70dba6ca5e3c3c9c14b3",
      "text": "敖丙在教练身边游。\n悟空看得眼睛亮亮的：\n“我也想学！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1c6ee425c2114e45014741e96c53bce384e8e1b74506b925ac47f6a03a9466b9",
      "text": "可一走到池边，\n悟空又缩回了脚趾。\n“我有点怕。”\n“没关系，咱们慢慢来。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4ecc081943143d9e1aaaa5f7642cb10cb7e7080d1342e744ecdb7a7cb28fd659",
      "text": "沙僧在池边陪着。\n教练伸出手：\n“准备好了吗？”\n悟空点点头。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "60a3eba6945957e12fbda9760c066efaf86dfdc3b874df62f322eed4f7645a25",
      "text": "悟空扶好池边。\n教练就站在他身旁。\n敖丙轻轻拍了拍水——哗！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d4b08fdeaab873349faa02e2aeef53e5f7b9f238fb4c10832063e8cfa72e66e5",
      "text": "三只小玩具，浮呀浮。\n小鲨鱼、海星，还有小丑鱼！\n“你们也来上课呀？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d639273e476666ef453bcd5de3db38b909ca7fb79e2c5863b076fb483d0a690a",
      "text": "教练拿来一个泡沫哑铃。\n两头蓝蓝的，又大又轻。\n悟空乐了：\n“小鱼也要练力气吗？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d1af8be94b6096374ca22b63435a2ca055201a245464d79cde5d97d6a6cd9d52",
      "text": "“这是帮咱们练习的。”\n悟空笑了，\n手还稳稳扶着池边。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a9328365d1b2fb0a1fd1429e59ca4215dff872006e1a798519930944d4e13882",
      "text": "教练把嘴轻轻贴近水面。\n咕噜，咕噜——\n悟空也吹出了小泡泡。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e10af34a5ddc02d37a9826da01f5275fcb82ca993f91bd0adaec781b6b15a4f5",
      "text": "水花碰到了下巴。\n悟空抬起脸，眨眨眼。\n“歇一会儿吧。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "01b913a08597658020a6ee23ce4c1f67196ac7aa1b0f4cd547ba5f8332018c20",
      "text": "又来上课啦。\n悟空扶好池边：\n“我的小泡泡又回来啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ae42c235d38d4ad05bc89998bd5b6fbf9d48620f4e5c5c2929a940ef1bfaff84",
      "text": "“教练，扶着我漂一会儿吧。”\n“好，我扶着呢。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "46db670428f202344ab954aaeb319a791b1b887e89e357585f13bfdc324d6a88",
      "text": "教练托着悟空，他慢慢漂起来。\n小肚皮像一只小船。\n“还是一只带尾巴的小船！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "650f2f3427e51d45c616d1c7f48f0fb0aab36a0ad8e56db69fd9189533af7c2b",
      "text": "又来上课啦。\n这回练习踢腿。\n“腿伸长，膝盖放松。”\n悟空把腿向后伸长。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3a92a3c3a67272d50cde1da101f1b6e3a668061b1f0cb630ad5906c9dbe2f625",
      "text": "“膝盖放松，轻轻踢。”\n水花变小啦。\n敖丙笑着说：\n“小鲨鱼也在看你呢！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "25b41451874113136dbdfb13d5bd0d18e3cd1fc7a6473b62ceca3146fff4db70",
      "text": "悟空握好泡沫哑铃。\n“头朝下，看水里。”\n他低头吹着泡泡，轻轻踢腿。\n教练一直扶着他。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d6a4ef8cdd82c3aa787a9a7d661ff939937b44802fe9d3d0b5084bd26c81d1d2",
      "text": "又练了几次，\n悟空想试试不用哑铃。\n“教练，你就在我身边吗？”\n“就在你身旁。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "615c8d42487f7bd3ece03c1f74963779eababf82d0aea6973c38b10fecced666",
      "text": "悟空向前游了一小段。\n教练就跟在旁边。\n悟空转向池边，伸手扶稳。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-19.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "71ced791d608ed4f9a7f1118b03ca10f650c9e6acc0091b9bf79079561601dac",
      "text": "“我游了一小段！”\n“我看见啦！”敖丙笑着说。\n下课了，教练扶悟空上台阶。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-20.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e9c99bb61f17a788fb43d6b0ec337f8911b28e4387ba6d2e3e2f9ab99dc3c2d9",
      "text": "三只小玩具，都回篮子啦。\n“晚安，小鲨鱼。”\n“今天你也忙坏啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-21.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a2a0a5e82ccb3d7d450fa81617f21460ac2a26e51f130a83154778db134ebe17",
